  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "設計倫理",
    "sub_ename": "DESIGN ETHICS",
    "describe_ch": "設計做為一門提供解決問題與滿足需求的專業服務的領域，其服務的委任建立在一種人與人之間的信任與契約關係中的權利與義務，需要所有利害關係人具備共同認知的道德意識。本課程為即將投入設計專業職場的學習者建立倫理的概念與價值觀的基礎認知，了解專業倫理與實務生態，透過設計倫理的個案研析，進行倫理觀念與設計實務的檢證與體認。",
    "describe_eh": "This course establishes a basic understanding of ethical concepts and values for students who are about to enter the design professional workplace. Through conducting a series of case studies on design ethics, students will be able to understand professional ethics and its practical ecology and develop their abilities to verify and recognize the ethical concepts in design practices.",
